// =====================================================================
// 6 月接入步骤 (≥ 5 steps to promote .ts.todo → .ts)
// =====================================================================
//
// 1. Rename this file to `crawler-team.ts` (drop the `.todo` suffix)
//    and uncomment the import + class blocks above. Do NOT change the
//    `name`/`source` strings — `metadata.source = 'crawler-team'` is
//    already what the dispatcher / quality module / weekly report
//    branch on.
//
// 2. Implement `discover` against the contract in handoff-v1 §4.3:
//    cursor pagination, `changed_since` for delta runs (default to
//    `last successful sync ts` persisted somewhere durable — Redis
//    key `kol-sync:crawler-team:last_sync_at` is fine), 429 with
//    Retry-After honoured.
//
// 3. Implement `mapHandoffItemToRawKolData`. The 1:1 column mapping is
//    in the contract block above; non-RawKolData fields (engagement /
//    audience demographics / monetisation) go into `raw` so B5
//    enrichment can promote them to columns later without re-fetching.
//
// 4. Add a tests/integration/crawler-team-adapter.test.ts that mounts
//    a `msw` (or similar) fixture server, exercises pagination +
//    delete-tombstones (§4.5) + 429 handling, and verifies that the
//    same handoff payload from §6 maps to a row whose Prisma upsert
//    matches what `import.ts` already produces for YouTube. Mirror
//    the existing tests/integration/import-kol-from-youtube.test.ts
//    structure.
//
// 5. Wire into `scripts/kol-sync-daily.ts`:
//       const dispatcher = new KolSyncDispatcher([
//         new YouTubeKolSyncAdapter(/*...*/),
//         new CrawlerTeamSyncAdapter({
//           baseUrl: process.env.CRAWLER_TEAM_API_BASE_URL!,
//           apiKey: process.env.CRAWLER_TEAM_API_KEY!,
//         }),
//       ]);
//    `runDailySync` already loops every adapter and surfaces partial
//    failures, so YouTube keeps running on days the crawler team has
//    an outage. No changes needed in dispatcher.ts / retry.ts /
//    quality.ts / log.ts.
//
// 6. Add the two new env vars to:
//      - `.env.production` and `.env.staging` on the VM
//      - the `Required env` section of `docs/dev/kol-sync-runbook.md`
//      - the secret-status table in `.auto-memory/environment.md`
//    Bump the cron quota cap in F004 alerts: now both adapters share
//    the same daily script, so `quota_consumed > 3000` becomes a
//    per-adapter check rather than a single sum.
//
// 7. Update `docs/product/KOLMatrix-MVP-PRD.md` §12 + this `.ts.todo`
//    file's status: rename the §12 bullet from "B6 KOLMatrix 自建 +
//    BL-012 6 月接入" to a single "双数据源已 live" entry and delete
//    this file (the implementation will live in crawler-team.ts).
